  "description": "Wetzel, Shelby, and Ebus may be brothers, but that doesn't mean they understand each other -- or women. Follow their wacky shenanigans as these three eccentric wizards try to run a struggling tavern on Hero's Road, file their taxes, and refill the pickle jar. Laugh so hard your lungs punch your eyeballs! Learn more about cooking than you ever wanted to know! Realize you're probably going to hell for laughing at this!\n\n- Webtoons",
